S-File-Encryptor is an open-source Android app for local file privacy and security. It combines file encryption, metadata removal, secure deletion, integrity verification and a hexadecimal editor — all in one lightweight, offline tool.

⸻

🔒 ENCRYPTION & DECRYPTION

Protect your files and folders with strong, modern cryptography:

• AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption with Argon2id key derivation (V2 format)
• Password-based encryption — no account, no cloud, no server
• Streaming I/O lets you encrypt large files without exhausting memory
• Authentication is always verified before decrypted data is written, protecting against tampered files
• Backward compatibility with legacy V1 encrypted files
• Biometric unlock (fingerprint) backed by the Android Keystore

⸻

🧹 METADATA REMOVAL

Files can carry hidden identifying information. S-File-Encryptor strips it while keeping your content intact:

• EXIF metadata removal from images (orientation preserved)
• OOXML sanitization for Office documents (docx and friends)
• PNG, WebP and GIF metadata validation
• PDF thumbnail and metadata cleanup
• Choose where to save the processed files

⸻

🗑️ SECURE FILE DELETION

Deleting a file normally leaves its data recoverable. The secure deletion feature performs an overwrite procedure before removing the file:

• Overwrite-before-delete procedure with status tracking
• Operation history with a unique Report ID per operation
• Detailed PDF reports you can export

⸻

✅ SHA-256 HASH VERIFICATION

Check that a file has not been altered or corrupted:

• Calculate SHA-256 hashes of any file
• Compare hashes to verify integrity
• Ideal for validating backups and downloads

⸻

🔧 INTEGRATED HEX EDITOR

Inspect and edit files at the byte level, powered by the BinEd hex editor (Apache-2.0, © ExBin Project):

• View binary file contents in hexadecimal
• Edit and save binary files
• A handy tool for developers and security enthusiasts

⸻

📖 OPEN FORMAT — NO LOCK-IN

Your files belong to you. S-File-Encryptor uses a fully documented, open file format — not a proprietary one:

• FORMAT_SPECIFICATION.md describes the complete binary format, so anyone can audit it or build compatible tools
• A standalone, cross-platform Python decryptor (sfe_decrypt.py) can decrypt any .aes file without the app
• Stream large files; output is only released after authentication succeeds

⸻

🛡️ PRIVACY FIRST

• Everything runs locally on your device — no internet permission required for core operations, no analytics, no ads, no trackers
• Derived keys are ephemeral: they exist only during an operation and buffers are zeroed afterwards
• Key material is protected by the Android Keystore

⸻

🌐 LANGUAGES

English and Portuguese (Brazil) — automatic according to your device settings.

⸻

🔐 Why S-File-Encryptor?

Because sensitive files deserve real protection without giving them to anyone. Whether it's personal documents, photos, work files or backups, S-File-Encryptor keeps them yours — encrypted, cleaned of hidden data, and verifiably intact.

